<title>Israel, Gaza and the West Bank: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/gaza/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-gaza-2026-11-22T22:38:33.798Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 22:38:33 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli settlers are setting fire to Palestinian villages in the West Bank, with graffiti accompanying the arson, and Defense Minister Gadi Eisenkot has condemned the attacks as &amp;quot;Jewish terrorism&amp;quot; while inviting Likud to marathon coalition talks. Medics say Israeli ambulances are being impeded in the West Bank, delaying care for the wounded. In Gaza, children are struggling to obtain life-saving insulin amid the siege. The Israeli military warned that a strike on Iran could trigger a multi-front war. The conflict has caused 21,440 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/west-bank-attacks-opposition-leader-eisenkot-decries-jewish-terrorism&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/middle-east/20261121-eisenkot-invites-netanyahu-s-party-for-marathon-israeli-coalition-talks&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168836&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/22/netanyahus-likud-eisenkots-yashar-end-coalition-talks-without-deal?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/middle-east/20261122-israel-s-eisenkot-slams-jewish-terrorism-after-attacks-by-settlers-in-west-bank&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxOZm9CNGQyVU1MUXlCUFdFdkthV0RVUDZBSzFvTGJDSlJ0bFBHV2tpXzU2NmZob0c3MmdIRWdQQVc4OU9DbjRuaTY2Z055X0xoQW5XWEs4ZnBLU1NYcFVCTlREX0lVaEpDdTRlcDNkVVJubURlZFVLWnh0czNCNUxOYWQwZ1JYQzNPMENsU21YbkJWRUIxUmtXSlRid2dvMm9IMzNUcHFGMDNPdXpNdm1ZZWc1LXR